[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0621","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0621.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0105","title":"HP-UX top 本地文件覆盖漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.04 及更早版本系统中自带的 top 工具存在文件覆盖漏洞，本地攻击者利用该漏洞可覆盖属于 \"sys\" 用户组的文件，导致系统完整性受损。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用 top 工具在处理文件时的权限缺陷，以 sys 组身份覆盖目标文件，造成非授权数据篡改。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0105"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 HP-UX 至 11.11（11i）或更高版本，该问题已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，以 root 执行 `chmod 555 /usr/bin/top` 移除 top 的 setgid 位，防止本地用户利用其特权覆盖 sys 组文件。同时限制非信任用户的本地登录权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2000-q4/0079.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5773","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0105.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0105.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0105","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0105.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0105.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0105.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f9ec51bb42a17e0dd0492f440cee3d253cc8275e/2001/CVE-2001-0105.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0105.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0105.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0105.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0621.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0620","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0620.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0104","title":"Alt-N MDaemon Pro 安全绕过漏洞","description":"MDaemon Pro 3.5.1 及更早版本存在安全绕过漏洞。本地攻击者可在密码提示框中点击\"取消\"按钮，再按下回车键，即可绕过\"锁定服务器\"安全设置，未经授权访问服务器管理功能。该漏洞利用条件低（需本地访问权限），但成功利用后可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0104"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:39Z","remediation":"升级 MDaemon Pro 至 3.5.2 或更高版本，该版本修复了在密码提示框点击取消后按回车键绕过\"锁定服务器\"安全设置的问题。如无法升级，建议在服务器本地安全策略中限制非管理员用户的交互式登录权限，并启用操作系统的屏幕保护程序密码保护作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/151156","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2115","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5763","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0104.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0104.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0104","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0104.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0104.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0104.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f9ec51bb42a17e0dd0492f440cee3d253cc8275e/2001/CVE-2001-0104.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0104.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0104.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0104.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0620.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0619","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0619.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0103","title":"CoffeeCup FTP客户端过弱密码加密漏洞","description":"CoffeeCup Direct和Free FTP客户端使用弱加密算法将用户密码存储在FTPServers.ini配置文件中。攻击者若能本地访问该配置文件，可轻易解密其中存储的FTP服务器密码，进而获取未授权的FTP访问权限。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者需具有本地文件读取权限，属于本地低复杂度攻击，无需用户交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0103"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:39Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用CoffeeCup Direct和Free FTP客户端，改用FileZilla、WinSCP等支持强加密存储密码的现代FTP客户端。如无法立即替换，应删除FTPServers.ini文件中存储的密码，并限制该文件的访问权限仅允许当前用户读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2107","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5744","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2001/CVE-2001-0103.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0103.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0103.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0103","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0103.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/d85e3a1792768837470e0c79fd15b0f8bd851146/CVEs/2001/CVE-2001-0103.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0103.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0103.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0103.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0103.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0619.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0618","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0618.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0102","title":"Apple Mac OS 9 权限提升漏洞","description":"Mac OS 9 的\"多用户\"控制面板存在权限提升漏洞，普通用户可通过删除 Users & Groups Data File 来绕过 Owner 密码验证，从而无需密码即可以 Owner 账户身份登录系统，获得完全的管理员权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，影响 Mac OS 9 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0102"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:39Z","remediation":"Mac OS 9 已停止安全支持，无官方补丁。建议升级至受支持的 macOS 版本（如 macOS Sonoma）。如无法升级，可将 Users & Groups Data File 权限改为仅系统管理员可读写（chmod 600），并限制普通用户对系统目录的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0497.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5830","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0102.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0102.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0102","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0102.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0102.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0102.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2001/CVE-2001-0102.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0102.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0102.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0102.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0618.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0617","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0617.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0096","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 FrontPage Server Extensions 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 和 5.0 中的 FrontPage 服务器扩展（FPSE）存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器提交特制的畸形 Web 表单，触发 FPSE 在处理表单数据时发生异常，导致 IIS 服务进程崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响运行 IIS 4.0/5.0 且启用了 FrontPage 服务器扩展的 Windows 服务器系统。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-100 中发布相关补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0096"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:38Z","remediation":"IIS 4.0 用户应立即安装微软安全公告 MS00-100 提供的补丁 Q280322i.EXE，或升级至 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 7；IIS 5.0 用户应安装对应补丁或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 2。如无需 FrontPage Server Extensions 功能，建议通过命令 `fpsrvadm -o uninstall -p all` 将其卸载以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-100","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5823","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2001/CVE-2001-0096.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0096.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0096.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0096","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2001/CVE-2001-0096.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0096.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0096.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0096.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0096.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2001/CVE-2001-0096.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0617.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0616","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0616.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0094","title":"NetBSD 和 FreeBSD Kerberos 4 认证库缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.5 及 FreeBSD 4.2 及更早版本中使用的 Kerberos 4 认证库 libkrb 的 kdc_reply_cipher 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当该库被集成到 telnetd、login 等 Kerberized 应用程序中时，本地攻击者可通过向该函数发送特制的认证响应数据触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据结构，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响范围包括 NetBSD 和 FreeBSD 系统上所有依赖 libkrb 进行 Kerberos 认证的服务程序，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。利用该漏洞需要本地系统访问权限，但无需身份认证即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0094"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:38Z","remediation":"FreeBSD 用户应升级至 4.2-STABLE（2000-12-13 之后）或 3.5-STABLE（2000-12-15 之后），或下载 FreeBSD-SA-01:25 补丁后执行 `cd /usr/src && patch -p < 补丁文件 && cd /usr/src/kerberosIV && make depend && make all install && cd /usr/src/libexec/telnetd && make depend && make all install` 重新编译 libkrb 和 telnetd。NetBSD 1.5 用户应升级至 2000-12-15 之后的分支版本，或下载 20001220-krb 补丁后重新编译 libkrb 和 telnetd。临时缓解措施：在 `/etc/inetd.conf` 中注释掉 telnet 服务行并重启 inetd 以禁用远程利用入口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5734","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0094.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0094.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0094","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0094.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0094.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0094.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2001/CVE-2001-0094.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0094.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0094.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0094.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0616.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0610","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0610.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0086","title":"CGI Script Center Subscribe Me LITE 未授权访问漏洞","description":"CGI Script Center Subscribe Me LITE 2.0 及更早版本存在身份验证绕过漏洞。subscribe.pl 脚本在处理删除邮件列表用户操作时未进行任何身份验证，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过直接调用 subscribe.pl 并传入目标邮箱地址作为参数，删除任意邮件列表用户。该漏洞影响 Subscribe Me LITE 2.0 及之前所有版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需知道目标邮箱地址即可实施攻击，可能导致邮件列表用户数据被批量删除，破坏邮件列表服务的正常运作。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0086"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 Subscribe Me LITE 至 2.0 以上版本（若厂商已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的邮件列表管理软件）。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器配置中为 subscribe.pl 添加 HTTP 基本认证（如 Apache .htaccess 配置 `AuthType Basic` 和 `Require valid-user`），或通过防火墙/反向代理限制对 subscribe.pl 的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0160.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2108","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5735","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0086.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0086.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0086","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0086.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0086.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5606c11566e9461a0d44f0944086969cb6810ef1/2001/CVE-2001-0086.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0086.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0086.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0086.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0086.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0610.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0607","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0607.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0085","title":"惠普 HP-UX Kermit 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.0 及更早版本中的 Kermit 通信软件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于软件在处理输入数据时缺乏足够的边界检查，本地攻击者可以通过向该软件发送特制的输入数据，触发缓冲区溢出，从而导致系统崩溃引发拒绝服务（DoS），或者在特定条件下以高权限执行任意系统命令，从而获取系统的完全控制权。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0085"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:37Z","remediation":"立即安装 HP 针对 Kermit 缓冲区溢出漏洞发布的安全补丁（参考 HP 安全公告 HPSBUX0012-148），将 Kermit 升级至修复版本。如无法立即打补丁，可移除 Kermit 二进制文件的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/kermit），并限制不可信本地用户的交互式登录作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2000-q4/0083.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2170","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5793","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0085.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0085.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0085","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0085.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0085.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5606c11566e9461a0d44f0944086969cb6810ef1/2001/CVE-2001-0085.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0085.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0085.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0085.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0085.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0607.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0606","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0027","title":"ProFTPD mod_sqlpw 权限提升漏洞","description":"ProFTPD 的 mod_sqlpw 模块在用户使用 \"user\" 命令切换 FTP 账户时，未能正确重置已缓存的密码，导致已认证的攻击者能够利用该缓存获取其他用户账户的访问权限，从而实现权限提升。该漏洞影响启用了 mod_sqlpw 模块的 ProFTPD 服务器版本，攻击条件要求攻击者首先获得一个低权限 FTP 账户的认证凭据。攻击者可先以普通用户身份登录，随后发送 \"user\" 命令切换至其他高权限账户，此时模块未清除的缓存密码会被复用，绕过正确的认证验证流程，最终获得被切换账户的完整访问和操作权限。该漏洞危害等级为高，CVSS 评分 7.5。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0027"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:30Z","remediation":"升级 ProFTPD 到包含 mod_sqlpw 模块密码缓存修复的版本（如 1.3.10 或更高版本），并确保在配置文件中正确配置 mod_sqlpw 模块，包括设置合适的密码缓存超时时间和清理机制。如无法立即升级，可通过限制使用\"用于\"命令的用户权限或在防火墙中禁用与 ProFTPD 相关的服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0139.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5737","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0027.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0027.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0027","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0027.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0027.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0027.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2001/CVE-2001-0027.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0027.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0027.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0027.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0604","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0604.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0081","title":"nCipher swinit 操作员卡组恢复功能绕过漏洞","description":"nCipher HSM（硬件安全模块）的 swinit 工具存在权限控制缺陷，当用户显式禁用 Operator Card Set（操作员卡集）恢复功能时，该工具未能正确执行禁用操作，导致该恢复功能仍处于启用状态。攻击者可利用此缺陷在无需认证的情况下远程访问并恢复操作员卡集，进而获取存储在 HSM 中的应用程序密钥。该漏洞影响使用 nCipher HSM 且启用了 swinit 工具的系统，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），属于中等危害级别的信息泄露漏洞。攻击者只需网络访问权限即可发起攻击，无需用户交互或特权认证。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0081"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 nCipher 软件至修复版本（参考厂商公告 http://active.ncipher.com/updates/advisory.txt），该版本已正确禁用 Operator Card Set 恢复功能。如无法升级，可在初始化安全世界（Security World）后手动检查 swinit 配置中 Operator Card Set recovery 选项是否已彻底关闭，并定期审计 HSM 日志确认无异常恢复操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://active.ncipher.com/updates/advisory.txt","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0152.html","http://www.osvdb.org/4849","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5999","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0081.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0081.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0081","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0081.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0081.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2001/CVE-2001-0081.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0081.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0081.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0081.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0081.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0604.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0603","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0603.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0079","title":"HP-UX Support Tools Manager 本地文件写入漏洞","description":"HP-UX Support Tools Manager (STM) A.22.00 版本存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建指向目标文件的恶意符号链接，诱使 STM 将日志写入 tool_stat.txt 时覆盖系统任意文件，导致权限提升或破坏系统完整性。攻击需本地用户权限，利用难度低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0079"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:37Z","remediation":"建议升级 HP-UX Support Tools Manager (STM) 至 A.22.01 或更高版本以修复符号链接问题。如无法升级，可临时移除 STM 相关二进制文件的 setuid 权限（`chmod u-s /opt/stm/bin/*`），并限制 tool_stat.txt 日志文件所在目录仅允许 root 用户写入，同时在 /tmp 目录设置粘滞位（sticky bit）防止本地符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0174.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0079.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0079.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0079","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0079.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0079.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0079.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2001/CVE-2001-0079.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0079.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0079.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/27ef30b72e2251e5a09f792eabf726cf380537a6/api/2001/CVE-2001-0079.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0603.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0602","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0602.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0078","title":"Sun Cluster 2.x 本地任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Sun Cluster 2.x 中的 in.mond 守护进程存在本地任意文件读取漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在运行 HA-NFS 的主机状态文件上实施符号链接攻击，利用该漏洞读取系统上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击条件为拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级低，CVSS 评分 2.1。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0078"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Oracle Solaris Cluster 4.x 或更高版本（Sun Cluster 2.x 已停止支持多年）。如无法升级，作为临时缓解措施：限制本地用户登录受影响的 HA-NFS 节点，使用 chmod 600 收紧 in.mond 状态文件权限，并启用 Solaris 内核级 symlink 保护（设置 fs.symlink_attack_protection=1）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0180.html","http://www.osvdb.org/6437","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6125","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0078.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0078.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0078","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0078.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0078.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0078.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2001/CVE-2001-0078.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0078.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0078.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0078.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0602.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0601","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0601.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0077","title":"Sun Cluster clustmon 服务未认证信息泄露漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Sun Cluster 2.x 中的 clustmon 服务未对远程访问进行身份认证，攻击者无需任何凭据即可通过发送特制网络请求直接获取系统日志与集群配置等敏感信息。该漏洞影响所有运行 clustmon 服务的 Sun Cluster 2.x 版本，攻击者只需在网络可达的前提下发送简单查询请求即可实现信息泄露，进而为后续针对性攻击提供关键情报。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0077"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36Z","remediation":"升级到 Sun Cluster 3.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 clustmon 服务无需认证即可访问的安全问题。如暂时无法升级，应立即联系 Sun 技术支持获取适用于 Sun Cluster 2.x 的安全补丁并安装。对于无需 clustmon 监控功能的系统，可直接停止 clustmon 服务并在 `/etc/inetd.conf` 中注释掉 clustmon 相关条目，防止远程未授权访问系统日志和集群配置信息。同时应在防火墙层限制对 clustmon 服务端口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0180.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6123","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0077.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0077.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0077","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0077.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0077.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0077.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5100979f8c44200a9b65976c3ddceb21c01ae6d/2001/CVE-2001-0077.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0077.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0077.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0077.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0601.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0599","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0599.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0073","title":"NSA Security-enhanced Linux 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NSA Security-enhanced Linux（SELinux）的 libsecure 库中 find_default_type 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向该函数传递特制输入触发缓冲区溢出，导致内存中关键数据被篡改，从而可能绕过 SELinux 安全策略或破坏系统完整性。该漏洞需要本地访问权限，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但仅影响数据完整性，不影响系统可用性和机密性。受影响的系统包括使用 NSA SELinux 的 Linux 发行版。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0073"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Linux 内核 2.6.0 及以上版本（SELinux 主线化版本），该版本已重写安全机制，不再使用存在漏洞的 libsecure 库。如无法升级内核，可限制本地用户对 SELinux 策略文件的写入权限，并监控 find_default_type 相关日志。对于现代发行版，确保 selinux-policy 包更新至最新即可。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/153188","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2154","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0073.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0073.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0073","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0073.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0073.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0073.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2001/CVE-2001-0073.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0073.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0073.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0073.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0599.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0598","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0598.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0069","title":"Debian GNU/Linux dialog 符号链接攻击导致任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Debian GNU/Linux 系统中 dialog 工具（0.9a-20000118-3bis 之前版本）存在任意文件写入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击（symlink attack）方式，诱使 dialog 在处理临时文件时覆盖系统任意文件，导致本地权限提升或系统文件被破坏。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0069"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:35Z","remediation":"升级 dialog 至 0.9a-20000118-3bis 或更高版本，该版本已修复临时文件创建时的符号链接竞态问题。如无法立即升级，应避免在多用户环境下以 root 权限运行 dialog 脚本，并确保临时目录（/tmp）设置了 sticky 位（chmod +t /tmp）以防止符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001225","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2151","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5809","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0069.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0069.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0069","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0069.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0069.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb4fa88be1e2cec066471c94ef8377b081c79cb6/2001/CVE-2001-0069.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0069.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0069.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0069.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/0